<component #flow.flow_dsl_reference_module_generator apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { kind = "component" } [
  <desc ?01M0NJZ4PWPBWWSJT9YYG57TWM>
  从 canonical docs/flow-dsl Markdown tree 生成 package-contained Halfcode ResourcePackage authoring module。
  </?01M0NJZ4PWPBWWSJT9YYG57TWM>
  <runtime ?r>
  type Runtime = NodeFileSystemAndHalfcodeResourceCore
  </?r>
  <input ?i>
  type Input = { sourceRootDir: string; outputRootDir: string; packageVersion: string }
  </?i>
  <config ?c>
  type Config = Readonly<{ sourceIdentity: "depa-flows/docs/flow-dsl" }>
  </?c>
  <output ?o>
  type Output = void
  </?o>
  <pseudo { kind = "ctrl" } ?p>
  枚举固定 Markdown root → UTF-16 排序 → 读取源 bytes 与 sha256 → 在 staging 生成 content、provenance 和 XNL resources → Halfcode validate → 原子替换 output
  </?p>
  <invariants ?01M0NJZ4PWPBWWSJT9YYG57TWN>
  canonical docs 是唯一内容 authority；无 host path policy、自然语言路由或第二 ResourcePackage parser。
  </?01M0NJZ4PWPBWWSJT9YYG57TWN>
]>

<object #flow.flow_dsl_reference_provenance apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { kind = "entity" fact_grade = "derived_projection_cache" single_writer = "modeling://domain/flow/flow_dsl_reference_module_generator" derived_from = "modeling://domain/flow/flow_dsl_reference_module_generator" } [
  <types ?t>
  interface FlowDslReferenceProvenance {
    schemaVersion: "depa.flow-dsl-reference/v1"
    moduleId: "DepaFlowsFlowDslReference"
    packageName: "ai-workflow-flow-dsl-reference"
    packageVersion: string
    resourcePackageVersion: "1.0.0"
    source: "depa-flows/docs/flow-dsl"
    sourceTreeDigest: `sha256:${string}`
    files: readonly { path: string; contentDigest: `sha256:${string}` }[]
  }
  </?t>
  <invariants ?01M0NJZ4PWPBWWSJT9YYG57TWP>
  这是 package-contained JSON provenance projection，不是 build 函数返回值；files 按固定 UTF-16 code-unit 顺序，sourceTreeDigest 绑定有序 path/contentDigest facts，每个 contentDigest 绑定 canonical source bytes。
  </?01M0NJZ4PWPBWWSJT9YYG57TWP>
]>

<port #flow.flow_dsl_reference_module_port apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { kind = "port" } [
  <desc ?01M0NJZ4PWPBWWSJT9YYG57TWQ>
  独立 reference package 面向 authoring consumer 的 package-contained module descriptor 端口。
  </?01M0NJZ4PWPBWWSJT9YYG57TWQ>
  <types ?t>
  type FlowDslReferenceModulePort = () => AuthoringModuleDescriptor
  </?t>
  <messages ?01M0NJZ4PWPBWWSJT9YYG57TWR>
  loadAIWorkflowFlowDslReferenceModule()
  </?01M0NJZ4PWPBWWSJT9YYG57TWR>
]>
